# Force LF for text config and data files so programmatic edits and
# cross-platform checkouts don't churn CRLF <-> LF (see read-me R-PROC-001).
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
# The api signature baseline is compared line by line, so a CRLF rewrite would look like a full removal.
*.txt   text eol=lf
# *.java is deliberately absent: 121 tracked sources are CRLF blobs, so an eol rule would rewrite them.
